    "content": "ether.fi is planning to significantly expand its lending capacity through a strategic collaboration with Aave and Optimism. The initiative involves deploying a dedicated lending instance on OP Mainnet. The project aims to scale its current borrowing capacity to hundreds of millions of dollars over the next few years, reflecting a major growth milestone for the crypto card issuer within the decentralized finance sector.",
